1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,660
I'm at the hardware store and I'm noticing a theme.
我在五金店里，发现了一个共同点。

2
00:00:03,160 --> 00:00:05,020
You either get fans
你要么买到风扇，

3
00:00:07,760 --> 00:00:09,180
or you get lights.
要么买到灯。

4
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:13,500
I can't find any of them that do fans and lights.
就是找不到把风扇和灯合在一起的。

5
00:00:13,520 --> 00:00:16,240
This is by far the cheapest that I have found,
这是我目前找到最便宜的一台，

6
00:00:16,241 --> 00:00:18,201
but there's still no lighting that comes with it.
但它照样不带照明。

7
00:00:18,202 --> 00:00:20,041
If you want to light, it's an additional cost.
如果还想要灯，就得另外花钱。

8
00:00:20,042 --> 00:00:22,841
So although these are all great lights and fans,
所以，虽然这些灯和风扇本身都不错，

9
00:00:22,842 --> 00:00:24,601
they do not have the combo,
但它们没有组合功能，

10
00:00:24,602 --> 00:00:25,961
which is what I was looking for
而我找的就是这种组合，

11
00:00:25,962 --> 00:00:28,481
and why I went with this one that I found on a TikTok shop.
所以我最后选了在TikTok Shop找到的这一台。

12
00:00:28,482 --> 00:00:33,261
Check it out. This is the camping fan and light combo.
看，就是这台露营风扇和灯二合一。

13
00:00:33,440 --> 00:00:35,280
The fan has four different speeds,
风扇有四档风速，

14
00:00:35,281 --> 00:00:37,141
the light has three different brightnesses,
灯有三档亮度，

15
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:41,780
and it even has oscillation so that it can rotate.
而且还能摇头转动。

16
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:46,160
And when you turn it around here you can see it's got a remote control
把它转过来，可以看到这里配有遥控器，

17
00:00:46,161 --> 00:00:47,681
so if you have it hanging in your tent,
如果你把它挂在帐篷里，

18
00:00:47,682 --> 00:00:50,341
you don't have to get up and manually push all the buttons.
就不用站起来一个个手动按按钮了。

19
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:51,480
Cause that would be lame.
不然也太麻烦了。

20
00:00:51,481 --> 00:00:52,641
You can turn on the lights,
你可以开灯、

21
00:00:52,642 --> 00:00:53,521
turn off the lights,
关灯，

22
00:00:53,522 --> 00:00:56,401
set your timers and everything right from the control.
设定时，各种操作都能用遥控器完成。

23
00:00:56,402 --> 00:00:57,481
And if you look on the bottom,
再看看底部，

24
00:00:57,482 --> 00:01:01,121
you have the USB A and USB C input output charging.
这里有USB-A和USB-C输入、输出充电接口。

25
00:01:01,122 --> 00:01:02,841
It comes with this hook on the bottom
底下还自带挂钩，

26
00:01:02,842 --> 00:01:04,721
so you can hang it from the top of your tent.
可以把它挂在帐篷顶部。

27
00:01:04,722 --> 00:01:07,841
Guys, this thing lasted for 11 and a half hours on a full charge.
各位，我这台充满一次电，实际用了11个半小时。

28
00:01:07,842 --> 00:01:09,436
I linked it below. Go get one!
链接放下面了，去买一台吧！
